---
// Site footer
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-col">
      <div class="footer-logo">codeobsessed_</div>
      <p class="footer-tagline">Honest answers for coders who are just getting started</p>
      <p class="footer-madein">Made in India 🇮🇳</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h3 class="footer-heading">Quick Links</h3>
      <ul class="footer-links">
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/articles">Articles</a></li>
        <li><a href="/roadmap">Roadmap</a></li>
        <li><a href="/settings">Settings</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h3 class="footer-heading">About</h3>
      <p class="footer-about">
        CodeObsessed was established to demystify the complexities of the modern programming landscape by providing structured, transparent guidance for aspiring developers.
      </p>
      <p class="footer-contact">
        <a href="mailto:pranjalbhatt2008@gmail.com">pranjalbhatt2008@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    &copy; 2025 CodeObsessed &middot; Pranjal Bhatt &amp; Shivansh Bansal &middot; Open source. Always free.
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: var(--bg-footer);
    padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .footer-madein {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-heading {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-links li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer-about {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-contact a {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-contact a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    border-top: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
